        },
        {
          "text": " Nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugambira aha bariisa abarikureeberera abantu bangye, naagira ati: Mutaataaniise obusyo bwangye, mwabubinga, timwabutaho mutima. Reeba, naanye ndyabafubira mbarute ebibi ebi murikukora; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
