        },
        {
          "text": " Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: N'ahabw'ekyo reeba, obunaku buryahika obu abantu bariba batakigira bati: Nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire, owaihire Abaisraeli omu nsi ya Misri; ",
          "type": "text",
