              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kureka bati: Nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire, owaareetsire baijukuru b'enju ya Israeli, akabeebembera naabaiha omu nsi y'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho n'omu nsi zoona ezi yaabaire ababingiiremu. Obwo nibwo barituura omu nsi yaabo ey'obuzaarwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.8"
            ]
